[00:00.42]Our Sov’reign Lord Jehovah
[00:04.76]Is zealous for his holy name.
[00:12.56]He fervently desires
[00:16.74]To clear it from unrighteous blame.
[00:25.52]Through many generations,
[00:30.48]Great endurance he has shown;
[00:36.36]In loving, kindly patience,
[00:41.36]Not weary has he grown.
[00:46.12]His will is that salvation
[00:53.48]All sorts of people might attain.
[00:58.73]Long-lasting, loving patience
[01:07.16]By God will not have been in vain.
[01:19.98]The quality of patience
[01:24.66]Will help us on our godly path.
[01:30.32]It lets our heart be tranquil,
[01:35.54]Protects us from unrighteous wrath.
[01:40.58]It finds the good in others,
[01:45.68]Always hoping for the best.
[01:50.88]It helps us keep our balance
[01:55.32]In times when we’re distressed.
[02:00.58]Along with other virtues
[02:08.36]That holy spirit can bestow,
[02:13.40]Our patience will assist us
[02:19.78]To imitate the God we know.
